uch more interesting is the choice of  the showrunner of season 1  because similar to the successful  project the witcher they want to  convince the very critical gaming  community  right from the start the next release of  the franchise which comprises 11 main  games is assassin's creed  valhalla but it is not yet possible to  estimate when this series will be  released  two years ago we saw hollywood superstar  jason statham in the underwater horror  movie mech by jonas taylor  at the box office the film grossed a  respectable 530 million us dollars  as the hollywood reporter now reveals  wanna brothers is already working on a  sequel to the successful first part  rebecca director ben wheatley will  direct the second part of the film which  is based around the prehistoric shark  megalodon  it is also clear that the original  director john turtletop will no longer  be involved in the film production  although the sequel has only been  officially announced recently  mack was the most successful horror  movie of the year in 2018 which is why  the idea of a sequel  has been circulating behind the scenes  for quite some time  no matter if you liked the movie or not  at least it made horror movies about  animals acceptable again after the  sharknado franchise had moved the whole  thing  more into a self-ironic and trashy  direction for years  by the way fans of the first part can  once again look forward to the large  part of the original team  including screenwriters john and eric  hober who are back on board for the  latest ocean adventure  behind the scenes lorenzo de bonoventura  and bella avery are involved as  producers an exact release date of mac 2  is unfortunately  not yet known oscar isaac became known  to a wide audience through roles in star  wars the force awakens and x-men  apocalypse  now according to report by variety the  41 year old is about to get involved in  the new marvel series  moon knight although the commitment has  not yet been officially confirmed  given the consensus in various movie  magazines it is considered  very likely on instagram fan account  venomology published a photo montage of  isaac and the black moon knight costume  the sad look also fits the background  story of the marvel character  because mark spector moon knight's real  name was fatally injured by his partner  on  expedition in egypt and could only  escape certain death with the help of  the moon god konchu  consequently he returns to earth as  avenger of the moon god  and fights crime with rather  controversial methods  thus the character is not a typical  superhero from the mcu  instead he often has to fight with  himself and his dark side  by the way the disney plus series is to  be directed by moammadia and behind the  scenes the project is also significantly  co-developed by jeremy slater a release  of the moon knight series is  as well as an official confirmation from  marvel still awaited  fans have been preparing for quite some  time for the possibility that the  characters in the upcoming the suicide  squad may die in early screen death  in addition director james gunn  published two new covers for the empire  magazine on twitter  that show the core of the cast in all  its glory empire  also has two exclusive pictures with  various team members in the works  including polka dot man peacemaker  bloodsport and  redcatcher 2. on twitter james gunn also  provided a lot of tension because  according to his own statement he can do  whatever he wants with the characters so  whoever survives or not the dc spectacle  is entirely in control of the director  in any case we are excited and look  forward to the expected release on  august 4th  [Music]  2021  [Music]  bye

